 "brief_gaps": [
  "Vertical slim wall lights in the oak flutes, roller blinds per wall and framed art: not modelled (flutes and facade blinds are).",
  "Mesh cable tray down the central aisle with downlights: the open ceiling's tray runs along each room's long axis, not along the derived aisle.",
  "Reception 'rounded-square ring-light rafts and black/brass pendants': approximated by capsule ring pendants at the CAD light positions on a charcoal open ceiling.",
  "timber_baffle_aisle / perforated_metal_aisle: applied to the whole workstation room, not only over the aisle (the aisle is a floor mask, the ceiling is per room).",
  "Tan rug and large planters in reception: rug_tan is defined; the CAD has no rug outline or planter blocks in RECEPTION, so none are placed.",
  "Paytm logo: text mesh 'paytm' (backlit white) on the stainless feature wall; replace with the logo artwork (PNG with alpha) via logo.image when available."
 ],
